=AdoRLvaYjleoP5VYCzXMcFN_3ZtYoMv8wTP0_-MtdzEQHbG_Au0A8ikrByKlNaq_67E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfykYwKKgTBVJiekWDwNkKGbewnQGBn0VfFItyLHx_YYGQ&oe=69D11F63"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "1332901451209610", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035426_1332901454542943_9137675190831643961_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l9LmBmPDglYQ7kNvwGjsT-g&_nc_oc=Adr4uyPTR8sxpI7eGn4uOeAqTgYo2c7TE5RDMn0bxI1elT-GVQRuHdgwzcuZpNYaWtI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyVboYpWQ1i7k0i9Ai_rvoxNVhDzX1lqFjWX7rFnlM8TA&oe=69D109D0"}, {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "1204208754212446", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982555_1204208757545779_923760938032234225_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3ES3qX2EaXMQ7kNvwHBpDco&_nc_oc=AdoSV8E20dH6QRNrtnTG2__uehbZfFc7TOwc0zASPxEXdWWoaEqhmpF0nmX_1M_QtmQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfycYbllZH24xEn6ks_1f2s0xB6BJD3PqRylS6ClsD-BPw&oe=69D0FBE7"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "1341448400169496", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982557_1341448406836162_5261155403751598858_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=35-kSNC2qsAQ7kNvwH9Wwvz&_nc_oc=AdqVPe8Aun7bIqzMR6k7F611tx3ZJD-82KYEHL3-NgEXJCt2jEF1lqikUHLFrNvOgr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzXUV_cqcHyeHc0VX4HeicH0J01Xo7fsswFSAJN60w_Tw&oe=69D0F13A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VK1.png", "id": "515514147973279", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974804_515514151306612_3479715154840138267_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rMQryXX_MHsQ7kNvwE1yXGC&_nc_oc=AdpERqE3LkZ3jMhjHgKmpUQ2rEMVoI5zSfGfPtL2fwEluk9K2J4tpHyfdmmYB7iM71Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx2uZ_-5q2UjOu11sM3vMxOasu2643S-oHnF_2EsiYBYg&oe=69D10E69"}, "display_name": "Virtual Kingdoms", "keywords": ["strategy", "battle", "command", "fight", "knight"], "long_description": "**Immerse yourself in the heat of battle.**\n\nExperience the thrill of real-time strategy in a fully immersive virtual reality environment. Choose from a variety of maps, each with its own unique terrain and challenges. Select your opponents and prepare for an epic clash.\n\n**Command Your Army from the Front Lines.**\n\nGather resources, build crucial structures, and train powerful units to dominate the battlefield. With intuitive VR controls, you'll feel like a true military commander, directing your forces with precision and strategy.\n\n**Annihilate Your Enemies.**\n\nOutmaneuver your opponents, launch devastating attacks, and seize strategic points to gain the upper hand. The ultimate goal is simple: eliminate your enemies and claim victory.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n- **Immersive VR Experience:** Feel the intensity of battle as you command your forces from the front lines.\n- **Strategic Gameplay:** Plan your attacks, manage resources, and build a powerful army.\n- **Diverse Maps:** Explore different environments, each with its own unique challenges and opportunities.\n\nAre you ready to take on the challenge and become the ultimate VR RTS commander?", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in the heart of battle as you command your forces in a fully immersive virtual reality experience. Gather resources, build powerful armies, and outmaneuver your opponents in epic clashes. With intuitive VR controls, you'll feel like a true military commander, strategizing and executing your plans with precision. Are you ready to take on the challenge and become the ultimate VR RTS dominator?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/vk_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": "https://vk.artisoft.pl/support.html", "website_url": "https://vk.artisoft.pl/", "category": null,